This license covers the code of Exilewright only. Not covered:

- Game data, images and sounds in poe2_data/available/ come from the files of
  Path of Exile 2. Path of Exile and its content are (c) Grinding Gear Games.
  Exilewright is a fan-made tool, not affiliated with or endorsed by
  Grinding Gear Games.

- mannequin.glb is the mannequin, with three of its animations, of the
  Universal Animation Library by Quaternius (https://quaternius.com),
  CC0 1.0 (public domain).

- wolf.glb is the Wolf of Quaternius' Animated Animal Pack
  (https://quaternius.com, from https://poly.pizza/m/P1gU3Qkr9r), CC0 1.0
  (public domain).

- three/ is three.js r160 (https://threejs.org), (c) 2010-2023 three.js
  authors, under the MIT license in three/LICENSE.

- moves.json holds fourteen animations of the KayKit Adventurers Character
  Pack and four of the KayKit Character Animations pack (the bow's), both by
  Kay Lousberg (https://www.kaylousberg.com), CC0 1.0 (public domain), turned
  into turns of the mannequin's joints.

- The class and ascendancy portraits in poe2_data/available/img/portraits/ are
  the "<Name> portrait.png" files of the Path of Exile 2 Wiki
  (https://www.poe2wiki.net), CC BY-NC-SA 3.0; the art is (c) Grinding Gear Games.

- Which modifiers each unique item has, in poe2_data/available/unique_items.json,
  is read from poe2db (https://poe2db.tw); the modifiers are the game's.

- installer/ChineseTraditional.isl is the Traditional Chinese translation of
  Inno Setup's messages, from its repository (https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc),
  under the Inno Setup license (https://jrsoftware.org/files/is/license.txt).

- poe2_data/available/pob2.json and trade_mods.json are derived from Path of
  Building Community (PathOfBuilding-PoE2), under this license:

  Copyright (c) 2016 David Gowor

